  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : Fraction of immersed part $f=\\frac{d}{\\rho}$\nCase-1,\n$f=1-0.4=0.6$\n$0.6=\\frac{d}{1}$\n$d=0.6$\nCase-2,\n\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& f=1-0.6=0.4 \\\\\n& f=\\frac{d}{\\rho_{\\text {oil }}} \\\\\n& 0.4=\\frac{0.6}{\\rho_{\\text {oil }}} \\\\\n& \\rho_{\\text {oil }}=1.5\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
